# Vercel CLI archive uploads ignore this file's entries instead of .gitignore,
# so everything that should not travel has to be named here explicitly.
#
# Without it the archive was 1.9 GB: node_modules (677 MB) plus the two .next
# directories (489 MB) plus turbo caches, all of which Vercel rebuilds anyway
# from `installCommand` and `buildCommand`.
#
# What must NOT be added here: packages/ui/src. apps/web's globals.css reaches
# out of its root directory with `@source '../../../../packages/ui/src'`, and
# excluding it would drop roughly 30% of the stylesheet with a green build.
node_modules
.next
dist
.turbo
out
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
.vercel
*.tsbuildinfo
